cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "layer" in publications use:'
type: software
license: CC0-1.0
title: 'layer: Tilt your Maps and Turn Them into ''ggplot'' Plots'
version: 0.0.4.9000
doi: 10.32614/CRAN.package.layer
abstract: Simplifies the whole process of creating stacked tilted maps, that are often
  used in scientific publications to show different environmental layers for a geographical
  region. Tilting maps and layering them allows to easily draw visual correlations
  between these environmental layers.
